71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_QJfyJM3tYMQ7kNvwHVSNJp&_nc_oc=AdqhHsH1Z8DO1fq-N71NDGH9hSwNg5QwvMofjFZR0KrGd_sjJPkoZze7t--uQph_eXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8BB7w9lUie0jUXFdcm4pE3ulhbsPLK4LuSEyjixLEBeQ&oe=6A3A85B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dVMMeozSUh0Q7kNvwG2jmlv&_nc_oc=Adp_cF8PEMcO6Lq88AF-4xd0aSCxE3W2_1QbRwVrYvStBWk9h4E_tri_SozOKfIB18o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9klHfu95XUZLoq9Bfs2qYUudmyCpjYjFx8raZBlX6IvQ&oe=6A3A9893"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kBtXR_ij4_4Q7kNvwFO9TLC&_nc_oc=AdoSg5Qkq2W2MI79zYUdpXTEzr_Ql_8IEEorOYI13tTHRy7xUs2wkWijWyOj4wlYFAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-xreHXEsJbpsIgzWq8-8QJ0LpllA7gUrt91-5Rlkjijg&oe=6A3A96DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: